/extras/8a19074510b40c3b6919cece8ac368cf.mp4?t=1753785620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Desktown</strong> is a cozy mini-planet that lives on the bottom corner of your screen. Whether you're watching videos, working, or gaming, your little town continues to grow\u2014turning your desktop into a charming, interactive space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898960/extras/de1e1fccf41e05354e6367ac05a22ef8.poster.avif?t=1753785620\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898960/extras/de1e1fccf41e05354e6367ac05a22ef8.webm?t=1753785620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898960/extras/de1e1fccf41e05354e6367ac05a22ef8.mp4?t=1753785620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898960/extras/596ad01252312cb9b0cc8ca4e00cc14f.avif?t=1753785620\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mini Planet:</strong> Minimize the planet while you work, watch videos, or play games. Stay focused and distraction-free, all while keeping an eye on your town and decorating your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Widgets:</strong> More than just a game\u2014it's a productivity tool! <strong> This demo offers one widget: Countdown.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expanded View:</strong> Ready to dive back in? Click the mini planet to instantly expand into a vibrant, full-screen view of your town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Automators:</strong> Sit back and relax while your town runs itself. Automate key resources like Population, Food, and Knowledge to keep things growing\u2014even when you're not actively playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decorations:</strong> Bring your town to life by placing decorations wherever you like. No more empty void\u2014make it uniquely yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Satellites:</strong> Play word-guessing mini-games! Type the correct words to earn bursts of valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Areas:</strong> Unlock towns across different themes and eras! <strong>This demo offers 2 areas \u2014 limited to 4 plantable zones.</strong></p>","developers":["Deskteam"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3848210","name":"Desktown"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898960/b404c641ca97a46a1f6277a17aaa880c4b8e7099/header.jpg?t=1753785620","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257172171,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172171/movie480.mp4?t=1753434229","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172171/movie_max.mp4?t=1753434229"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257172171/999777914e503ea76f06b797500ebef6e51b5f34/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753434229","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172171/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753434229","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172171/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753434229"}}],"name":"Desktown Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-1135G7 @ 2.40GHz (8 CPUs), ~2.4GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Di